# Infrastructure Integrations

This folder contains application infrastructure integrations and runtime-facing adapters for external services and shared infrastructure, such as Redis.

- `logger/` is reserved for logging infrastructure integrations; logger setup lives in `src/configs/logger.config.ts`.
- `redis/` is reserved for Redis infrastructure integration code.

- `src/server.lifecycle.ts` manages HTTP server startup and graceful shutdown.

Update this guide when integrations or responsibilities in this folder change.
